{"unit_id":"GitRuozhi__dsh-github-mcp#card-zh","repo":"GitRuozhi/dsh-github-mcp","commit":"5be9077d46bfed66b76843bbcc7bdc459990b3af","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-github-mcp 是面向 DSH Web 的 GitHub 工具桥接插件，通过官方 MCP 服务接入 GitHub 仓库、代码、Issue 和 Pull Request 工具，并注册 github_file_read 补充文件正文读取与目录浏览。调用读取工具时提供仓库所有者、仓库名和路径，可选指定分支、标签或提交；它返回 UTF-8 文件文本或目录条目。适合需要在 DSH 对话中搜索 GitHub 资源、查看代码或处理协作事项的用户。运行时需配置 GITHUB_TOKEN；MCP 服务连接 api.githubcopilot.com，文件读取连接 api.github.com。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:16-30","lib/index.js:18-39","lib/index.js:92-123"]}
{"unit_id":"GitRuozhi__dsh-github-mcp#card-en","repo":"GitRuozhi/dsh-github-mcp","commit":"5be9077d46bfed66b76843bbcc7bdc459990b3af","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-github-mcp adds GitHub’s official MCP tools to DSH Web for repository, code, issue and pull request tasks. Its github_file_read tool returns file text or directory listings, with an optional branch, tag or commit. Set GITHUB_TOKEN; requests use api.githubcopilot.com and api.github.com.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:16-30","lib/index.js:18-39","lib/index.js:92-123"]}
