{"unit_id":"GitRuozhi__dsh-github-mcp#feature-1","repo":"GitRuozhi/dsh-github-mcp","commit":"5be9077d46bfed66b76843bbcc7bdc459990b3af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-github-mcp 的功能「GitHub 官方工具接入」：将官方 MCP 服务注册为 DSH 可调用的 GitHub 工具，覆盖仓库、代码、Issue 和 Pull Request 等操作。工具通过远程 MCP 端点提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:16-26"]}
{"unit_id":"GitRuozhi__dsh-github-mcp#feature-2","repo":"GitRuozhi/dsh-github-mcp","commit":"5be9077d46bfed66b76843bbcc7bdc459990b3af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-github-mcp 的功能「读取文件和列出目录」：调用 github_file_read 并提供仓库所有者、仓库名与路径，可选指定 ref；返回解码后的 UTF-8 文件文本或目录条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-39","lib/index.js:59-76","lib/index.js:92-123"]}
{"unit_id":"GitRuozhi__dsh-github-mcp#feature-3","repo":"GitRuozhi/dsh-github-mcp","commit":"5be9077d46bfed66b76843bbcc7bdc459990b3af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-github-mcp 的功能「查看较大文件提示」：读取超过 Contents API 内联限制或未返回内联内容的文件时，工具会给出文件大小及通过 raw endpoint 或克隆仓库读取的提示，不返回文件正文。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:72-85"]}
{"unit_id":"GitRuozhi__dsh-github-mcp#feature-4","repo":"GitRuozhi/dsh-github-mcp","commit":"5be9077d46bfed66b76843bbcc7bdc459990b3af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-github-mcp 的功能「按版本读取」：读取 GitHub 文件时可以传入分支、标签或提交 SHA 作为 ref；未指定时使用仓库默认分支。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-29","lib/index.js:103-107"]}
{"unit_id":"GitRuozhi__dsh-github-mcp#caveat-1","repo":"GitRuozhi/dsh-github-mcp","commit":"5be9077d46bfed66b76843bbcc7bdc459990b3af","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-github-mcp 使用前须知：需在 DSH 进程环境配置 GITHUB_TOKEN；MCP 与文件读取请求分别连接 api.githubcopilot.com 和 api.github.com，并携带 Bearer token。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:22-24","lib/index.js:18-38"]}
